    "display_name": "Animal Adoption",
    "long_instructions": "## Compare Data Completeness\r\n\r\n### Do This:\r\n\r\n1. Look through the `animals` array.\r\n2. Compare how much information each animal has.\r\n3. Focus on the `bio` field across animals.\r\n\r\n\r\n### Reflect:\r\n\r\n- Which animals have more detailed information?\r\n- Which have less or missing information?\r\n- Which animal would you be more likely to choose? Why?",
